    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Konfigurasi Message Column Config",
      "id": "details-message-column-config",
      "intro": "Sub-tab Message Column Config memungkinkan pengguna mendefinisikan struktur kolom pada file XLSX dan tipe data setiap kolom sesuai format transaksi yang akan diproses. Setiap kolom memetakan posisi indeks dengan nama field dan tipe data tertentu, sehingga sistem dapat membaca file Excel dengan akurat.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Daftar & Detail Column Config",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Tabel menampilkan struktur kolom XLSX yang terdaftar untuk Message Type terpilih.\n• Pilih endpoint dari panel **List Endpoint** di sidebar kiri untuk memuat konfigurasi kolom.\n• Informasi kolom mencakup:\n  - **Column Index:** Nomor urut kolom di file XLSX (dimulai dari 0) dengan badge abu-abu.\n  - **Column Name:** Nama field kolom disertai ikon kolom biru.\n  - **Data Type:** Tipe data (STRING, INTEGER, DECIMAL, DATE, BOOLEAN) dengan badge outline.\n  - **Mandatory:** Status wajib field (MANDATORY, CONDITIONAL, OPTIONAL) dengan badge berwarna.\n• Gunakan tombol **Search** untuk menyaring data dan **Add Column** untuk menambahkan kolom baru.",
          "color": "#107c41",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.08);border:1px solid #bbf7d0;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#f0fdf4;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Column Config</span><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;\">Search</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#107c41;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">+ Add</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:0;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:9px;\"><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc;\"><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Idx</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Column</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Type</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">DER</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><span style=\"padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;\">0</span></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\">cardNumber</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;\">STRING</span></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(239,68,68,.1);font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">M</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><span style=\"padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;\">1</span></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\">amount</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;\">DECIMAL</span></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(249,115,22,.1);font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#ea580c;\">C</span></td></tr></table></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Form Tambah / Edit Column Config",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\nDrawer form menyediakan field berikut:\n1. **Column Index** *(Wajib)*: Nomor urut kolom di file XLSX (0-based).\n2. **Column Name** *(Wajib)*: Nama field yang akan dipetakan.\n3. **Data Type** *(Wajib)*: Pilih tipe data kolom (STRING, INTEGER, DECIMAL, DATE, BOOLEAN).\n4. **DER Type** *(Wajib)*: Status kewajiban field — pilih MANDATORY, CONDITIONAL, atau OPTIONAL.\n5. **Description** *(Opsional)*: Deskripsi singkat kegunaan kolom.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border:1px solid #bbf7d0;background:#fff;width:280px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #bbf7d0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdf4,#dcfce7);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#107c41;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Create Column Config</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Fill column details and save</div></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;font-size:9.5px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Index <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">0</div></div><div style=\"flex:2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Column Name <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Enter name</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Data Type <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Choose</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">DER Type <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Choose</div></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 14px;border-top:1px solid #bbf7d0;display:flex;gap:6px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:5px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:5px;border-radius:5px;background:#107c41;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">Create</button></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
